NPDev General workspace root marker.
Required by local/CI root resolution after roadmap cleanup.
Do not delete.

Only this file's EXISTENCE is ever tested (Get-NPDevWorkspaceRoot in scripts/npdev-common.ps1,
NPDevRuntimeHost/build.gradle, FinalAppAssembler.java). Nothing parses its content.

Note that a generated FinalApp carries its own copy of this marker, so the marker ALONE does not
identify this repo -- every root resolution pairs it with the top-level module directories
(NPDevContract / NPDevGenerator / NPDevKernel), which a generated app does not have. See
Get-NPDevBuildRoot's comment in scripts/npdev-common.ps1 for why root detection must never key on
the repo's directory NAME.
